     "titulo": "Dialogue: raising a public need",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "讨论「办事、服务与城市生活」时，社区最需要先了解什么？",
       "alumno": "When discussing «procedures, service and city life», what does the community most need to find out first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我觉得先了解实际情况比较好。",
       "alumno": "I think it's better to start by understanding the real situation.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你能举一个例子吗？",
       "alumno": "Can you give an example?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "可以，我们先从身边的事情说起。",
       "alumno": "Yes; we can start with something close to us.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: raising a public need",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "改善「办事、服务与城市生活」相关的公共服务，首先要了解居民的实际需要。",
       "alumno": "To improve public services related to «procedures, service and city life», first you need to understand residents' real needs.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "收集意见之后，应说明如何处理，并让结果可以查询。",
       "alumno": "After collecting opinions, it is advisable to explain how they will be dealt with and to make the results available to check.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "先把问题说清楚，再举一个例子，最后说明自己的想法。",
       "alumno": "First state the problem, then give an example, and finish by explaining your opinion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
